           03 COMMAREA.
              COPY X372VT06.

      **************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DFHCOMMAREA.
      **************************************


           PERFORM 1000-INICIO.

           PERFORM 2000-PROCESO.

           PERFORM 9000-FIN.

      ******************************************************************
      *1000-INICIO.
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO.

           EXEC CICS
              ASKTIME ABSTIME (WS-TIEMP)
           END-EXEC

           EXEC CICS
              FORMATTIME ABSTIME(WS-TIEMP)
              YYYYMMDD (WS-FECHA)
           END-EXEC

           EXEC CICS
                IGNORE CONDITION ERROR
           END-EXEC

           EXEC CICS
                ASSIGN APPLID (NOMBRE-CICS)
           END-EXEC

           MOVE '00'       TO X372VT06-CRETORNO-S.
           MOVE 'B372VT06' TO X372VT06-GNOMPROG-S.


      ******************************************************************
      *2000-PROCESO.
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROCESO.

      *D*
      *    DISPLAY 'ANIOEJER-E ' X372VT06-ANIOEJER-E
